{
  "info": {
    "name": "Foreign National Onboarding (Facia.ai)",
    "description": "End-to-end foreign national onboarding flow. Passport-only KYC via Facia.ai. Captures country of origin + country of residence at initiate.\n\n**Service:** onboarding-workflow-service (port 8089)\n**Base path:** /api/v1/onboarding/foreign\n**Workflow ID format:** foreign-onboarding-{sha256(email).first16hex}\n\n## Flow\n1. **Initiate** — email + mobile + countryOfOrigin + residentialCountry → dual OTP sent (stub `123456`)\n2. **Verify OTP** — both OTPs → Keycloak user → JWT\n3. **Upload passport** — base64 image → Facia OCR + authenticity\n4. **Confirm data** — review/correct extracted fields (incl. passport dates, origin, residence)\n5. **Upload selfie** — base64 selfie → Facia face-match (threshold 0.70) → customer + wallet\n6. **Set PIN** — 6-digit PIN\n7. **Enable biometrics** — Face ID / Touch ID (skippable) → COMPLETED → onboardingComplete=true\n8. **Status** — query full state by email\n\n## Variables\n- `baseUrl` — Kong: `http://46.62.226.94:8000/onboarding-service` · Direct: `http://localhost:8089`\n- `email`, `mobile`, `countryOfOrigin`, `residentialCountry` — set before initiate\n- `stubOtp` — `123456`\n- `passportImageBase64`, `selfieImageBase64` — paste base64 PNG/JPEG before steps 3 & 5\n- Auto-set: `workflowId`, `accessToken`, `customerId`, `walletId`, `keycloakUserId`, `faciaPassportRefId`, `faciaSelfieRefId` + extracted fields",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://46.62.226.94:8000/onboarding-service", "description": "Kong gateway. For direct hit: http://localhost:8089" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "foreign-test@example.com" },
    { "key": "mobile", "value": "+14165552233" },
    { "key": "countryOfOrigin", "value": "PAK", "description": "ISO-3166 alpha-2 or alpha-3" },
    { "key": "residentialCountry", "value": "CAN", "description": "ISO-3166 alpha-2 or alpha-3" },
    { "key": "stubOtp", "value": "123456" },
    { "key": "tenantId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" },
    { "key": "deviceId", "value": "postman-foreign-device" },
    { "key": "passportImageBase64", "value": "", "description": "Paste base64 PNG/JPEG of passport before step 3. Raw base64 or data: URI accepted." },
    { "key": "selfieImageBase64", "value": "", "description": "Paste base64 selfie before step 5." },
    { "key": "pin", "value": "936182" },
    { "key": "confirmPin", "value": "936182" },
    { "key": "workflowId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "keycloakUserId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "faciaPassportRefId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "faciaSelfieRefId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "customerId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "walletId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "extractedSurname", "value": "" },
    { "key": "extractedGivenName", "value": "" },
    { "key": "extractedDob", "value": "" },
    { "key": "extractedNationality", "value": "" },
    { "key": "extractedPassportNumber", "value": "" },
    { "key": "extractedIssueDate", "value": "" },
    { "key": "extractedExpiryDate", "value": "" },
    { "key": "extractedAddress", "value": "" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Initiate (origin + residence + dual OTP)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = r.data || r;",
              "if (d.workflowId) pm.collectionVariables.set('workflowId', d.workflowId);",
              "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
              "pm.test('workflowId set', () => pm.expect(d.workflowId).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
              "pm.test('currentStep is OTP_SENT', () => pm.expect(d.currentStep).to.eql('OTP_SENT'));",
              "console.log('workflowId =', d.workflowId);",
              "console.log('OTP (stub) =', pm.collectionVariables.get('stubOtp'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Tenant-Id", "value": "{{tenantId}}" },
          { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobile}}\",\n  \"countryOfOrigin\": \"{{countryOfOrigin}}\",\n  \"residentialCountry\": \"{{residentialCountry}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/foreign/initiate"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Verify dual OTP (Keycloak user + JWT)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = r.data || r;",
              "if (d.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', d.accessToken);",
              "if (d.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', d.refreshToken);",
              "if (d.keycloakUserId) pm.collectionVariables.set('keycloakUserId', d.keycloakUserId);",
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('currentStep is OTP_VERIFIED', () => pm.expect(d.currentStep).to.eql('OTP_VERIFIED'));",
              "pm.test('accessToken returned', () => pm.expect(d.accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"mobileOtp\": \"{{stubOtp}}\",\n  \"emailOtp\": \"{{stubOtp}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/foreign/verify-otp"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Upload passport (Facia OCR)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = r.data || r;",
              "if (d.faciaReferenceId) pm.collectionVariables.set('faciaPassportRefId', d.faciaReferenceId);",
              "if (d.extractedData) {",
              "    const e = d.extractedData;",
              "    if (e.last_name) pm.collectionVariables.set('extractedSurname', e.last_name);",
              "    if (e.first_name) pm.collectionVariables.set('extractedGivenName', e.first_name);",
              "    if (e.dob) pm.collectionVariables.set('extractedDob', e.dob);",
              "    if (e.nationality) pm.collectionVariables.set('extractedNationality', e.nationality);",
              "    if (e.document_number) pm.collectionVariables.set('extractedPassportNumber', e.document_number);",
              "    if (e.issue_date) pm.collectionVariables.set('extractedIssueDate', e.issue_date);",
              "    if (e.expiry_date) pm.collectionVariables.set('extractedExpiryDate', e.expiry_date);",
              "    if (e.full_address) pm.collectionVariables.set('extractedAddress', e.full_address);",
              "}",
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('currentStep is PASSPORT_UPLOADED', () => pm.expect(d.currentStep).to.eql('PASSPORT_UPLOADED'));",
              "pm.test('Facia returned reference id', () => pm.expect(d.faciaReferenceId).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"passportImageBase64\": \"{{passportImageBase64}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/foreign/upload-passport",
        "description": "Send base64-encoded passport. Either raw base64 or `data:image/png;base64,...` is accepted (the adapter normalises). Facia returns first_name / last_name / dob / document_number / issue_date / expiry_date / nationality / full_address."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Confirm extracted data (user edits)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = r.data || r;",
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('currentStep is DATA_CONFIRMED', () => pm.expect(d.currentStep).to.eql('DATA_CONFIRMED'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"surname\": \"{{extractedSurname}}\",\n  \"givenName\": \"{{extractedGivenName}}\",\n  \"nationality\": \"{{extractedNationality}}\",\n  \"dateOfBirth\": \"{{extractedDob}}\",\n  \"passportNumber\": \"{{extractedPassportNumber}}\",\n  \"issueDate\": \"{{extractedIssueDate}}\",\n  \"expiryDate\": \"{{extractedExpiryDate}}\",\n  \"homeAddress\": \"{{extractedAddress}}\",\n  \"countryOfOrigin\": \"{{countryOfOrigin}}\",\n  \"residentialCountry\": \"{{residentialCountry}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/foreign/confirm-data",
        "description": "Body is pre-filled from variables auto-captured in step 3. Override any field the user corrected before sending."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Upload selfie (Facia face match → customer + wallet)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = r.data || r;",
              "if (d.faciaReferenceId) pm.collectionVariables.set('faciaSelfieRefId', d.faciaReferenceId);",
              "if (d.customerId) pm.collectionVariables.set('customerId', d.customerId);",
              "if (d.walletId) pm.collectionVariables.set('walletId', d.walletId);",
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('currentStep is SELFIE_VERIFIED', () => pm.expect(d.currentStep).to.eql('SELFIE_VERIFIED'));",
              "pm.test('customerId issued', () => pm.expect(d.customerId).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
              "pm.test('walletId issued', () => pm.expect(d.walletId).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
              "pm.test('face match score >= 0.70', () => pm.expect(parseFloat(d.faceMatchScore)).to.be.at.least(0.70));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"selfieImageBase64\": \"{{selfieImageBase64}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/foreign/upload-selfie",
        "description": "Workflow calls Facia /face-match with selfie + passport image from step 3. Threshold 0.70 — below that returns 400 with currentStep=FAILED."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Set 6-digit PIN",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = r.data || r;",
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('currentStep is PIN_SETUP', () => pm.expect(d.currentStep).to.eql('PIN_SETUP'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"pin\": \"{{pin}}\",\n  \"confirmPin\": \"{{confirmPin}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/foreign/set-pin"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Enable biometrics → COMPLETED",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = r.data || r;",
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.test('currentStep is COMPLETED', () => pm.expect(d.currentStep).to.eql('COMPLETED'));",
              "pm.test('onboardingComplete is true', () => pm.expect(d.onboardingComplete).to.eql(true));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"skipped\": false\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/foreign/enable-biometrics"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7b. Skip biometrics (alternative)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "X-Device-Id", "value": "{{deviceId}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"enabled\": false,\n  \"skipped\": true\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/foreign/enable-biometrics"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Status (query by email)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const r = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = r.data || r;",
              "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "console.log('Current step:', d.currentStep);",
              "console.log('Customer:', d.customerId);",
              "console.log('Wallet:', d.walletId);",
              "console.log('Onboarding complete:', d.onboardingComplete);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/onboarding/foreign/status?email={{email}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "onboarding", "foreign", "status"],
          "query": [{ "key": "email", "value": "{{email}}" }]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
